:''Not to be confused with'' ''[[Elephantidae Papaou]].''
'''Le'Behemoth''' (悪魔ベヒモッス, ''Akuma Behimossu'', '''Devil Behemoth''') is an [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] variant of [[Le'boin]] that appears in [[The Aku Realms]] and [[Uncanny Legends]]. He was added in [[Version 10.9 Update|Version 10.9]].

